## English

This project was generated by `kmvpy create`. The Python project lives in the `__PY_PROJECT_NAME__/` directory.

### Quick Start

Open the generated outer workspace root in Cursor so the preset `.vscode/settings.json` and `.vscode/launch.json` remain available.

Create a virtual environment and install the runtime dependencies:

```bash
cd __PY_PROJECT_NAME__
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e ".[postgresql]"
```

Run `Python: Select Interpreter` in Cursor, select `__PY_PROJECT_NAME__/.venv`, and start the application:

```bash
cd __PY_PROJECT_NAME__
source .venv/bin/activate
python app/run.py
```
